Today’s Activities
Attacking the web application: In today's portion of Project 2, you are tasked with finding all vulnerabilities in Rekall's new web application. There are 15 "flags" hidden across the web application, and a flag will display once you successfully exploit a vulnerability.

Your instructor will send out your student guide to complete today's tasks.

As you work, remember to take screenshots of your vulnerability findings and to update your penetration testing summary report. You can use this templateLinks to an external site. for your report (remember to make a copy first!).